{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06577","headline":"行次田家澳梁作 · 储光羲","name":"行次田家澳梁作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"田家俯长道，邀我避炎氛。\n当暑日方昼，高天无片云。\n桑间禾黍气，柳下牛羊羣。\n野雀栖空屋，晨昏不复闻。\n前登澳梁坂，极望温泉分。\n逆旅方三舍，西山犹未曛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06577.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06577","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}